guide completionist-horde/attune-tome-of-dalaran
title Tome of Dalaran (City of Dalaran item)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
folder Completionist attunements and keys
levels 1-60
zone Alterac Mountains
pitch Tome of Dalaran: Calls up Lyn the Ignored, a hidden boss, at the summoning circle in the City of Dalaran's Underbelly, in the small room past Atrexis the Grave Knight. The Black Tome lies on a table up the stairs behind Archmage Arugal in Shadowfang Keep; use it at the Ambermill Leyline Focus, the blue crystal beside Archmage Ataeric in Ambermill's town hall, and it becomes the Tome of Dalaran.
why Calls up Lyn the Ignored, a hidden boss, at the summoning circle in the City of Dalaran's Underbelly, in the small room past Atrexis the Grave Knight. The Black Tome lies on a table up the stairs behind Archmage Arugal in Shadowfang Keep; use it at the Ambermill Leyline Focus, the blue crystal beside Archmage Ataeric in Ambermill's town hall, and it becomes the Tome of Dalaran.

step Tome of Dalaran
  tip Calls up Lyn the Ignored, a hidden boss, at the summoning circle in the City of Dalaran's Underbelly, in the small room past Atrexis the Grave Knight. The Black Tome lies on a table up the stairs behind Archmage Arugal in Shadowfang Keep; use it at the Ambermill Leyline Focus, the blue crystal beside Archmage Ataeric in Ambermill's town hall, and it becomes the Tome of Dalaran. No quest gives it: it comes from inside City of Dalaran; the arrow leads to the entrance.
  zone map 1416
  collect 275989 x1 @8.8,59.6 map 1416 optional
